[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18183.03, "timestamp": "05:03:03", "text": "等等，我現在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18184.31, "timestamp": "05:03:04", "text": "開始了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18207.23, "timestamp": "05:03:27", "text": "嘿，那是南邊的裝卸貨平台。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18214.39, "timestamp": "05:03:34", "text": "是的。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18216.31, "timestamp": "05:03:36", "text": "就算只是蓋一道牆之類的，也會產生很大的影響。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18217.39, "timestamp": "05:03:37", "text": "哦，好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18218.75, "timestamp": "05:03:38", "text": "我同意。一個，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18220.868, "timestamp": "05:03:40", "text": "這裡有迫擊砲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18223.548, "timestamp": "05:03:43", "text": "在哪裡？"}]